  "releaseNotes": "- **Renamed `ManiaAPI.Xml` to `ManiaAPI.MasterServer`**\n- **Renamed `XmlRequestException` to `MasterServerResponseException`** and `XmlResponseDetails` to `MasterServerResponseDetails`\n- Added `MasterServerError`, `MasterServerResponseException.Error`, and error codes in `AggregatedSummaryInfo` for typed master server error handling\n- Changed unreadable responses to throw `MasterServerResponseException` instead of `Exception`\n- Fixed XML escaping of logins, title IDs, map UIDs, campaigns, and zones\n- Fixed parsing of negative numbers depending on the current culture\n- Updated the User-Agent to report the installed package version\n- Added .NET 11 support",
